ise, the fourth son of Jacob by Leah.","verses":245,"father":"Israel","mother":"Leah","v":[22]},{"id":"hur_1571","name":"Hur","also":"","summary":"The husband of Miriam, Moses’ sister (Ex. 17:10-12). He was associated with Aaron in charge of the people when Moses was absent on Sinai (Ex. 24:14).","verses":12,"father":"Caleb","mother":"Ephratah","v":[22]},{"id":"bezaleel_490","name":"Bezaleel","also":"","summary":"In the shadow of God; i.e., “under his protection”, the artificer who executed the work of art in connection with the tabernacle in the wilderness (Ex. 31:2; 35:30).","verses":8,"father":"Uri","mother":"","v":[22]},{"id":"uri_2895","name":"Uri","also":"","summary":"Tribe of Judah.","verses":5,"father":"Hur","mother":"","v":[22]},{"id":"dan_973","name":"Dan","also":"","summary":"The fifth son of Jacob. His mother was Bilhah, Rachel’s maid (Gen. 30:6, “God hath judged me”, Heb. dananni).","verses":63,"father":"Israel","mother":"Bilhah","v":[23]},{"id":"aholiab_170","name":"Aholiab","also":"","summary":"Tent of the father, an artist of the tribe of Dan, appointed to the work of preparing materials for the tabernacle (Ex. 31:6; 35:34; 36:1, 2; 38:23).","verses":5,"father":"Ahisamach","mother":"","v":[23]},{"id":"ahisamach_159","name":"Ahisamach","also":"","summary":"","verses":3,"father":"","mother":"","v":[23]}],"places":[],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[6213,6213,4196,4196,5930,5930,5930,7848,7848,6086,7251,7251,7251,2568,520,753,2568,520,7341,7969,7969,520,6967],[6213,6213,7161,7161,5921,5921,5921,702,702,6438,7161,7161,7161,7161,7161,7161,1961,4480,4480,4480,6823,6823,6823,5178,5178,5178,5178],[6213,6213,3605,4196,4196,3627,5178,5178,5518,3257,4219,4219,4207,4207,4289,4289],[6213,6213,4345,4345,5178,5178,7568,4196,4196,4196,8478,3749,3749,2677,4295,4295,4295,4295],[702,702,702,7117,5178,5178,5178,4345,3332,3332,702,2885,1004,1004,905,905,905],[6213,6213,6213,905,905,7848,7848,6086,6823,6823,853,5178,5178],[935,